				"string" : "The **Browser** manages the user interface, and the **Browsee** manages the content.\n\nAt startup time  {{gtMethod:Hub class>>startUp}}  an auction selects the most suitable class to be  {{gtMethod:Hub class>>winningHubClass}} .   Subclasses can override {{gtMethod:Hub class>>onStartUpBidToBeCurrent}} to outbid {{gtMethod:GlamorousˆHub class>>onStartUpBidToBeCurrent}}  if they wish to be in control."
